title: "Notion Work Hub with Claude (workhub-claude)"
abstract: "Claude Code skills, hooks and a Notion template that run a personal research task hub (Inbox, Tasks with Score and dependencies, topic cards, Done reports) together with the user's conversations, workstations and computing clusters."
